# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the disaggregation step-1 window (docs/tp4-disagg-step1.md; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/disagg and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry. Templates only.
# D1: the TP4 comparator of D2 on the same path: general-tp4-bench (G1, 8 seats x 131,072, gate only) on all four cards, the SAME bench shapes and prompts as D2 (same checkout,
# same corpus offsets) plus what only TP4 holds: a 1x130000 prefill (the 128k point) and 8 live at 4k. r(L) = D2 ttft / D1 ttft at 4k/32k/60k; k(n) = D1 rate / D2 rate at 1/2/4
# live. agreement: the TP4 greedy answers for tp_agreement.py compare against D2's (expected: NOT bit-equal, near-tie divergence as J2/J2r, docs/tp4-g1-bringup.md).
# READ: bench-general-tp4-bench.json, agreement-general-tp4-bench.json, the smoke log clean. Duration (estimate): reset 3-12 min, engine 10-20 min, bench ~20 min, agreement
# 5-10 min: 40-60 min (box 90).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next2-1
C2_PROFILE=general-tp4-bench
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,bench,agreement
C2_BENCH_SHAPES=1x4096,1x32768,1x60000,1x130000,2x4096,4x4096,4x32768,8x4096
C2_BOX_MINUTES=90
